to panic Caroline.

170
00:07:56,260 --> 00:07:58,000
我想先去明察暗访一下
I need to do some detective work,

171
00:07:58,060 --> 00:07:59,380
你跟我一起去
so you and I are gonna go down

172
00:07:59,380 --> 00:08:00,540
杰西卡的婚礼规划公司
to Jessica's wedding planning business

173
00:08:00,540 --> 00:08:01,520
然后假装是一对情侣
and pretend we're a couple.

174
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:03,040
显然  我来当新郎
Obviously I'll be the groom.

175
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:06,560
麦克斯  这事虽然你可能听了会惊讶
Max, this might come as a surprise to you,

176
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:08,060
但我很忙好吗
but I'm a very busy man.

177
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:10,560
我没时间陪你去幼稚胡闹
I don't have time for your sophomoric high jinks.

178
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:13,080
大家也这么说亚当·桑德勒的喜剧电影
Uh, that's what they said to Adam Sandler,

179
00:08:13,140 --> 00:08:14,380
结果只让他更富上加富了
and it only made him richer.

180
00:08:15,660 --> 00:08:17,420
作为你的陪伴首选  我深感荣幸
I'm flattered I was your first choice.

181
00:08:17,900 --> 00:08:19,980
兄弟  我早你好几轮就被邀请了
Man, she asked me five people ago.

182
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:22,620
她好像问到最后就剩你跟扫帚
I think she was down to you or a broom,

183
00:08:22,660 --> 00:08:24,020
而扫帚又在忙
and the broom was busy.

184
00:08:25,900 --> 00:08:29,580
如果我真陪你去  那我们得拿出最佳的演技
If I'm doing this, we have to use our best acting skills,

185
00:08:30,392 --> 00:08:32,220
毕竟谁会相信你能钓到我这金龟婿
'cause who's gonna believe you landed me?

186
00:08:33,860 --> 00:08:36,280
要是"扫帚"先生4点没普拉提课就好了
Ugh, really wish Steve the Broom didn't have Pilates at 4:00.

187
00:08:39,700 --> 00:08:41,620
真的很对不起  菲拉罗太太
I'm so sorry, Mrs. Ferraro.

188
00:08:41,860 --> 00:08:43,980
我真的不知道你就是那个
I had no idea you were the awful boss

189
00:08:43,980 --> 00:08:45,360
让她生活苦不堪言的恶魔老板
that was making her life miserable.

190
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:47,860
鲍比  你为何没告诉我
Bobby, why didn't you tell me

191
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:50,260
你妈妈有一家"邮寄与其他事务"啊
your mom owns a Mail Boxes and Other Things?

192
00:08:50,400 --> 00:08:52,680
我怕你因为我家无限量的气泡膜而爱我
I didn't want you to date me for the unlimited bubble wrap.

193
00:08:53,640 --> 00:08:55,280
丹妮斯无法适应外面世界
Denise can't cope out in the world.

194
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,920
你明知道她摸过
You know how many times she's touched

195
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:58,120
我们邻居的通电篱笆多少回了
our neighbor's electric fence.

196
00:08:58,120 --> 00:09:00,160
讲道理  他们装电篱笆
To be fair, they installed it

197
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:01,440
也是为了防止她再掉进他们泳池
to keep her from falling in their pool.

198
00:09:02,620 --> 00:09:04,480
事是你惹的  你得负责摆平
Well, you did this. You take care of it.

199
00:09:04,580 --> 00:09:06,020
她现在是你的责任了
She's your responsibility now.

200
00:09:06,220 --> 00:09:08,340
鲍比  帮我外带一点甜品回家
Bobby, bring home some deserts for me.

201
00:09:08,740 --> 00:09:09,055
从甜甜圈连锁店带
From Dunkin'!

202
00:09:11,380 --> 00:09:13,240
鲍比  真的很对不起
Bobby, I am so sorry.

203
00:09:13,340 --> 00:09:15,600
我不想我们首次吵架是因为一些误会
I don't want our first fight to be over a misunderstanding.

204
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:17,320
我希望我们是因为某件大事而吵
I want it to be about something important,

205
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:19,220
比如你想留唇下一撮小胡子
like if you want a soul patch.

206
00:09:20,729 --> 00:09:21,480
我们不是吵架
We're not fighting.

207
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:22,460
只是点小摩擦
This is a bump.

208
00:09:22,620 --> 00:09:23,740
你反应过度了
I think you're overreacting.

209
00:09:24,580 --> 00:09:25,900
那你干嘛吼我
Then why are you yelling?

210
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:27,560
我没吼你啊
I'm not yelling.

211
00:09:28,540 --> 00:09:29,880
天啊  怎么吼成这样了
Man, what's with all the yelling?

212
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:34,580
奥列格  快来看好戏
Oh, Oleg, let's see where this goes.

213
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:37,500
已经比亚马逊拍的所有电视剧都好看了
It's already better than everything on Amazon.

214
00:09:39,020 --> 00:09:40,880
要是能更《权力的游戏》风就好了
Just with it was a little bit more Game of Thrones-y.

215
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,340
鲍比露
Bobby.

216
00:09:48,260 --> 00:09:49,480
卡洛琳  我们真不是吵架
Caroline, we're not fighting.

217
00:09:50,380 --> 00:09:52,480
但拜托你以后别再介入
But please, don't get in the middle

218
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:53,780
我妈跟丹妮斯之间的事了
of my ma and Denise again.

219
00:09:53,980 --> 00:09:54,900
我阿姨试过一次
My aunt tried once.

220
00:09:54,900 --> 00:09:56,920
现在她超级害怕吊扇
Now she's really scared of ceiling fans.

221
00:09:57,540 --> 00:09:59,960
我得走了  我还是找不到我的手机
I gotta go. I still can't find my phone.

222
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:03,260
奥列格  这是我们消遣的新节目
Oleg, this is our new show.

223
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,660
快把我包里的爆米花拿出来
Grab the popcorn from my purse.

224
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:09,120
你想吃咸的还是甜的
You want cheddar cheese or kettle corn?

225
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:12,180
你们知道我听得见你们说话  对吧
You know I can hear you, right?

226
00:10:15,260 --> 00:10:16,820
这里肯定是杰西卡的办公室
Okay, this must be Jessica's office.

227
00:10:17,020 --> 00:10:19,280
给  最好把这个戴上
Oh, here, better put this on for the bit.

228
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:21,200
这可是来自朝鲜
This was smuggled out of North Korea

229
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:23,920
是我曾祖父藏在屁股里偷带出来的
by my great-grandfather in his great backside.

230
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:27,160
经典的屁股形切割
Oh, the classic tush cut.

231
00:10:29,140 --> 00:10:31,300
记住  我们是侦探
Now remember, we're detectives.

232
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:32,320
我是警花
We're like Cagney

233
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:34,300
而你是唯一能拖来跟我办案的家伙
and the only guy I could get to come with me.

234
00:10:36,340 --> 00:10:36,980
你们好呀
Hi.

235
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:39,220
你们肯定是麦克斯和阿憨
You must be Max and Han.

236
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:40,800
我是杰西卡
I'm Jessica.

237
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:43,120
非常感谢你们能来店里
Thanks so much for coming in.

238
00:10:43,900 --> 00:10:46,200
你们这对真是超级无敌可爱
Oh, you guys are so super cute.

239
00:10:47,140 --> 00:10:50,620
我们的可爱度能直逼...宝宝吗
How does our cuteness compare to, say, a baby?

240
00:10:51,660 --> 00:10:52,980
你们想得真远
Wow, you're thinking ahead.

241
00:10:52,980 --> 00:10:55,780
还是你已经怀有小不点了
Or are you expecting a little one?

242
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:58,040
我已经有一个小不点了
Ha, I've already got a little one.

243
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,500
你呢
What about you?

244
00:11:01,060 --> 00:11:03,460
取笑我的身型是我们专属的秀恩爱方式
Making fun of my size is kind of our thing.

245
00:11:03,760 --> 00:11:05,440
比如还有  甜蜜地滚床单
Like, making sweet love.

246
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,980
所以我有"孩子"  你呢
So I'm with child. Are you?

247
00:11:14,380 --> 00:11:15,380
老实说  我...
Actually, I'm...

248
00:11:15,380 --> 00:11:16,240
关于婚礼
So for the wedding,

249
00:11:16,500 --> 00:11:18,620
我想要自然主题
I was thinking of a nature theme.

250
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:21,180
在公园里举办  各种奇思妙想
Something in the park, whimsical of course,

251
00:11:21,180 --> 00:11:23,180
比如彩灯和鲜花  以及一个大帐篷
with lanterns and flowers, a big tent.

252
00:11:23,420 --> 00:11:24,700
你不是吧
Oh, oh, really?

253
00:11:25,180 --> 00:11:26,960
小笑星你还想要大帐篷啊  别打断杰西卡
You want a big top, Pee-wee? Jessica was talking.

254
00:11:28,860 --> 00:11:29,720
抱歉  亲爱的
Sorry, dear.

255
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:32,540
我老伴很讨厌我插嘴
The old ball and chain hates when I get a word in.

256
00:11:33,300 --> 00:11:34,300
让我们长相厮守  永不插嘴
Sign me up for a lifetime.

257
00:11:36,660 --> 00:11:39,680
抱歉  我刚没听清你说生小孩的事
Sorry, uh, I missed what you were saying about having a baby.

258
00:11:40,100 --> 00:11:41,900
今天的主角可不是我
We're not here to talk about me.

259
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:43,920
是你们和你们的喜事[婚外情]
Let's talk about you and your affair.

260
00:11:44,300 --> 00:11:46,780
放心  我绝对会有的
Oh, I'm definitely gonna have one.

261
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:53,800
多谢发短信给我  卡洛琳
Thanks for texting, Caroline.

262
00:11:54,160 --> 00:11:57,080
自从你让我炒掉我妈后  我有点迷失方向
I've been a little lost since you made me quit my job with Ma.

263
00:11:57,400 --> 00:11:59,260
大部分是因为我找不到来这儿的地铁
Mostly 'cause I couldn't find the L train.

264
00:11:59,820 --> 00:12:01,540
但我看见一个男人杀一只鸡呢
But I saw a guy kill a chicken.

265
00:12:02,940 --> 00:12:04,900
我是想着跟你聚一聚
I thought you and I could get together

266
00:12:04,900 --> 00:12:06,840
一起想想你职业生涯的下一步该怎么走
and figure out your next career move,

267
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:10,080
其实不一定要往前走
which does not necessarily need to be forward.

268
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:13,160
不  我才不会回我妈的店里
No, I'm not going back to my ma's store

269
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:15,100
无论我有多怀念藏在箱子里
no matter how much I miss hiding in boxes

270
00:12:15,100 --> 00:12:16,100
到处吓唬别人
and scaring people.

271
00:12:17,560 --> 00:12:20,580
让我们发散思维  想想你该找什么工作
Well, let's brainstorm on your next career move.

272
00:12:21,900 --> 00:12:23,900
我一直很想当模特
I've always wanted to be a model.

273
00:12:25,420 --> 00:12:27,900
有人说我不穿裤子时美呆了
I've been told I look great with my pants down.

274
00:12:30,940 --> 00:12:32,920
你的价值并不止于那身皮囊
You are more than just a body.

275
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:35,340
有时候我也不确定
Hmm, sometimes I'm not so sure.

276
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:38,100
不如我在这儿工作吧
Hey, what about working here?

277
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,940
能有多难  你都做得来
How hard can it be? You do it.

278
00:12:41,060 --> 00:12:42,640
老实说  这份工作需要很多...
Actually, this job requires a lot...

279
00:12:42,660 --> 00:12:44,400
你不用再说服我了  我就在这儿干了
You don't have to talk me into it. I'll do it.

280
00:12:45,360 --> 00:12:46,940
把装有饮品的飞盘给我
Give me the Frisbee with the drinks on it.

281
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:51,460
好吧  你就帮忙到麦克斯回来就好
Okay, I guess you could help out until Max gets back.

282
00:12:51,540 --> 00:12:53,740
又或者到有人受伤了  那个人很可能是我
Or until someone gets hurt, probably me.

283
00:12:55,820 --> 00:12:58,480
傍晚时分  夕照城市
As magic hour descends over the city,

284
00:12:58,780 --> 00:13:01,560
我和麦克斯将前往我们的蜜月套房
Max and I will retire to the honeymoon suite

285
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:03,340
而她会抱着我  跨过门槛
where she carries me over the threshold.

286
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:07,100
接下来会发生什么  想想都激动
Excited for what's to come.

287
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:10,780
反正来什么  我们俩都不会来[高潮]
Well, it's not gonna be either of us.

288
00:13:14,740 --> 00:13:16,300
说回你吧  小杰
So, uh, back to you, Jess.

289
00:13:16,300 --> 00:13:18,860
派对礼品可以是小指南针
Ooh, the party favors could be little compasses

290
00:13:18,860 --> 00:13:20,560
这样能指引客人入席
that lead you to your table.

291
00:13:21,700 --> 00:13:23,540
或引到一艘等着的逃生船
Or to a waiting escape boat.

292
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:27,860
你俩确定彼此适合结为夫妻吗
Are you sure you two are right for each other?

293
00:13:28,460 --> 00:13:29,340
开什么玩笑
Are you kidding?

294
00:13:29,920 --> 00:13:31,840
我爱死他了
I am obsessed with him.
